    <body>
      <p><seg source="#source-30-50">霜つききたり</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-50-76">木ぬれをそむると</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-76-99">おもひしものを</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-99-122">庭にあづまやの</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-122-139">遠見をそめ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-139-162">うすべにさせる</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-162-176">魚をそめ</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-176-199">わかるるきみの</seg></p>
      <p><seg source="#source-199-214">くちをそめ</seg></p>
    </body>
